WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:23.921
Hi! Who are you?

2
00:00:23.922 --> 00:00:27.127
I'm a skunk.

3
00:00:27.128 --> 00:00:31.743
Skunks are small mammals.

4
00:00:31.744 --> 00:00:34.661
Where do you live?

5
00:00:34.662 --> 00:00:39.425
Skunks live in North and South America.

6
00:00:39.426 --> 00:00:43.845
We like forests and mountains.

7
00:00:43.846 --> 00:00:47.940
Some skunks live in cities.

8
00:00:47.941 --> 00:00:53.534
I like your white stripes!

9
00:00:53.535 --> 00:00:57.604
A lot of skunks have stripes.

10
00:00:57.605 --> 00:01:00.873
Others have spots.

11
00:01:00.874 --> 00:01:05.433
All skunks are black and white.

12
00:01:05.434 --> 00:01:08.437
What do you eat?

13
00:01:08.438 --> 00:01:13.022
Skunks eat bugs and small animals.

14
00:01:13.023 --> 00:01:17.327
We also like plants and fruit.

15
00:01:17.328 --> 00:01:22.113
Skunks look for food at night.

16
00:01:22.114 --> 00:01:25.334
Where do you sleep?

17
00:01:25.335 --> 00:01:30.484
Skunks sleep in hollow logs or holes.

18
00:01:30.485 --> 00:01:36.666
Sometimes we sleep in other animals' homes.

19
00:01:36.667 --> 00:01:40.628
We sleep during the day.

20
00:01:40.629 --> 00:01:44.783
Do you have any enemies?

21
00:01:44.784 --> 00:01:49.373
Owls sometimes hunt us.

22
00:01:49.374 --> 00:01:54.148
But most animals stay away from us.

23
00:01:54.149 --> 00:01:59.856
Why do they stay away from you?

24
00:01:59.857 --> 00:02:03.727
Skunks can make a spray.

25
00:02:03.728 --> 00:02:11.156
We shoot enemies with the spray.

26
00:02:11.157 --> 00:02:19.255
The spray smells awful!

27
00:02:19.256 --> 00:02:23.944
Uh-oh! I see a fox.

28
00:02:23.945 --> 00:02:30.971
Stand back!

29
00:02:30.972 --> 00:02:36.978
Good-bye, Skunk!
